At max-width 880, `.bottom-hud` becomes 2 columns with ability cluster row 1, vitals/weapon row 2. The bottom-hud bottom 14px. The touch controls overlay it. On iPhone, the bottom-hud's weapon card is at row 2 right, around bottom, but the touch fire button overlaps. The HUD "weapon HUD" seems to be at the bottom right behind the fire button. Need to shift the bottom HUD up above the touch controls on coarse pointers. Add a `@media(pointer:coarse)` rule:
```
.bottom-hud { bottom: calc(170px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
.toast-stack { bottom: 210px; }
